{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2023-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1673136000, "end_date": 1673827199, "month_true_total": 935, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:15:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "130938170", "author": {"steamid": "76561198249897262", "personaname": "OnPoint", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OnPointBtw/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 10629, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10206, "last_played": 1674413034, "avatar": "614780b16ef7478fb532a19243c340df41ec3579"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very realistic game, maybe too hardcore for some\nBut if you like realism this is your game", "timestamp_created": 1673825387, "timestamp_updated": 1673825387, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130934361", "author": {"steamid": "76561199231926867", "personaname": "exq_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199231926867/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7908, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1799, "last_played": 1773522373, "avatar": "9b8e985b36b79c604a092db092f84abe5e54c236"}, "language": "english", "review": "amazing game", "timestamp_created": 1673820304, "timestamp_updated": 1673820304, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130934067", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019073132", "personaname": "Power-Mechanist Engineer", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019073132/", "num_games_owned": 670, "num_reviews": 132, "playtime_forever": 170, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 170, "last_played": 1673819167, "avatar": "25a711c7187e126ef426f5766ea5a6f4c3e4fba6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gameplay starts out tense and exciting, but turns into a boring walking-simulator.\nVehicle-combat  comes very, very late and you can't even change your loadout to your liking.\nThe missions will teleport you oddly around the maps, without you even leaving the base on your own.\n\nOn paper there are tons of vehicles and weapons, ingame you must hope the mission lets you play even a fraction, if any.\n\nI was hoping the AI has been fixed and wasn't as braindead as in the previous titles anymore, but your buddies are as blind and unresponsive as before.\n\nTried to find a coop-server, but the server-browser is as bad as Insurgencies.\nToo many modded servers (and the servers aren't even capable to provide you with the necessary files - you know? Like even 20 year old DOOM-servers are capable of!) or servers that run only with the overpriced DLCs.\n\nUI is... ugly. Just plain ugly and underdesigned. Its a good thing the game tries to explain everything through a tutorial and tutorial-messages, but the UI is so... bland and terrible.\n\nThen there is the issue with \"battle-eye\" that causes the game to crash!\n\nAnd last but not least:\nBugs, bugs, bugs.\nEnemies or friendlies running around in circles. Or you take a look at a base through your binoculars, and the units are performing a weird dance, running around like headles chicken.\n\nCars get stuck in terrain, whole squads are running into enemy-positions like charging in a WW1-battle.\n\nIs this supposed to be \"realism\"?", "timestamp_created": 1673819958, "timestamp_updated": 1673821129, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130929855", "author": {"steamid": "76561198274033792", "personaname": "Woehey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Woehey/", "num_games_owned": 46, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 13991, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13796, "last_played": 1673825516, "avatar": "a79e3b3759957b78919969eb1d66ebe16b884429"}, "language": "english", "review": "Guns", "timestamp_created": 1673815166, "timestamp_updated": 1673815166, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130929084", "author": {"steamid": "76561198160776560", "personaname": "Areo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Coolboisonly/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4625, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4236, "last_played": 1780777827, "avatar": "dac324606251ebdadad7a5afa8e153b70ec220f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "YES VERY GOOD WOULD RECCOMEDNAKJD/'/", "timestamp_created": 1673814311, "timestamp_updated": 1673814311, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}